SUMMARY:Jason: Scandia\, MN
DESCRIPTION:Spiritual retreat at Bethany Center for Prayer & Renewal\n\nSta
 tus: Confirmed\nBethany Center for Prayer & Renewal\, 23393 Nolan Ave N\, S
 candia\, MN 55073. Website: https://bethanyretreats.org/.\nTypical arrival
  is between 6:00-7:00 PM Sunday. Orientation is at 7:15 PM Sunday\, then si
 lence begins.\nSilence breaks Friday evening with dinner and sharing of gra
 ces with the other retreat guests.\nTechnically free to leave after dinner
  around 7:00 PM Friday\, but most stay the night and leave first thing Satu
 rday. Nothing is scheduled Saturday morning.\nFlight planning target: MSP\,
  unless retreat location changes.\n\nView live: https://jstravelschedule.ne
 tlify.app
LOCATION:Scandia\, MN
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
